AFAIK, the only way to increase the likelihood of your pet dropping
items (but also of him picking items up) is to increase its
tameness--try throwing him meatballs. However, this will not get rid of
your pet's slowness. A good remedy for that is a wand of speed.

Cancellation is quite permanent, but it's a moot point anyway because
tame creatures do not use breath weapons (which is the only reason I
can think of why you would be concerned about this).

No matter how hard you beg, Mr. Gray isn't going to quaff those
potions. That is, unless you polymorph him into something with the
apposite opposable digits. :-P

